Revert Telemetry Service functionality to get to a stable spot between 3 Telemetry Service collections:
1) Metric Definitions, 2) Metric Report Definitions, and 3) Metric Reports. Currently the three collections are being developed independently upstream and previously I had pulled them in at mismatched commits. 

This enables a working Metrics Definition, Metric Report Definition, and Metric Report. 
*Please note the Telemetry framework is still a work in progress and [some gaps remain in each of the collections](https://github.com/openbmc/bmcweb/commit/4028ff77ddebe603b009a8afaf6bc36bc5949612#diff-885cb2df9a5cc562ba63283b70aae50dd18656ff13578fc760740308849aff22).


